<view class="page">
  <view class="section-heading">
    <view>
      <text class="section-kicker">LEGAL SERVICES</text>
      <text class="section-title">服务中心</text>
    </view>
    <text class="section-count">5 项服务</text>
  </view>

  <view class="service-grid">
    <view
      wx:for="{{services}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="service-card {{item.featured ? 'service-card-wide' : ''}}"
      bindtap="handleServiceTap"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
    >
      <view class="card-top">
        <view class="service-mark mark-{{item.tone}}">
          <text>{{item.mark}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="service-label">{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="service-name">{{item.name}}</text>
      <text class="service-desc">{{item.description}}</text>
      <view class="service-footer">
        <text>进入服务</text>
        <view class="arrow-button"><text>></text></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="note">
    <view class="note-line"></view>
    <text>具体服务安排与处理结果以平台工作人员反馈为准。</text>
  </view>
</view>
